Date: Fri, 15 May 2026 06:23:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/6] Add Claude Code-like CLI system for Ponyou management

Adds three new tools for remote management of all Ponyou features:

1. ponyou-cli.js - Interactive menu-driven CLI with configuration for:
   - LLM provider setup and switching
   - Trading parameters (capital, targets, stop-loss)
   - Risk management (position limits, profit targets)
   - Screening thresholds with presets (conservative/balanced/aggressive)
   - Strategy selection and technical indicators
   - Scheduling and cycle intervals
   - Vault auto-savings configuration
   - Telegram notifications
   - Agent status monitoring
   - Configuration validation and testing
   - Full reset capability

2. ponyou-dashboard.js - Real-time monitoring dashboard with auto-refresh:
   - Status section (trading state, open positions, mode)
   - Performance metrics (win rate, trade count, P&L)
   - Configuration display
   - Learning system statistics
   - Quick action menu
   - Auto-updates every 5 seconds
   - Color-coded metrics

3. PONYOU-CLI-GUIDE.md - Comprehensive documentation:
   - Quick start guide
   - Detailed menu option descriptions
   - Configuration file documentation
   - Advanced commands
   - Typical workflows
   - Troubleshooting guide

These tools enable full remote management of Ponyou similar to Claude Code,
with no need for direct code editing or SSH access.

